  "description": "“The hidden harmony is stronger than the visible.”\n Heraclitus, Fragment B54\n\nForce Matrix explores the coexistence of protection and latent force within a single morphology.\n\nLike the tension shared by the bow and the lyre, the same underlying structure may produce harmony or release an arrow. What appears gentle can become resistant; what shelters the body can also extend its power beyond itself.\n\nThe hidden is not secondary, but the source from which the form acquires its potential to act.\n\nModelled in Zbrush and Maya, rendered in Arnold.",
